<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffc107 0%, #ff9800 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
        }
        .appointment-details {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .detail-item {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>📅 Appointment Request Received</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{ patient.firstName }} {{ patient.lastName }},</p>
        
        <p>Thank you for booking an appointment with us! Your appointment request has been <strong>received</strong> and is currently pending approval.</p>
        
        <div class="appointment-details">
            <h3>Appointment Details:</h3>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <strong>Doctor:</strong> Dr. {{ doctor.firstName }} {{ doctor.lastName }}
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <strong>Date:</strong> {{ appointmentDate|date('F d, Y') }}
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <strong>Status:</strong> <span style="color: #ffc107; font-weight: bold;">Pending</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <p>We will review your appointment request and notify you once it has been accepted or rejected. You will receive an email notification with the final status.</p>
        
        <p>If you have any questions or need to make changes, please contact us as soon as possible.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong>ChoufliDoc Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
